				</h3>
				<div style="background: var(--post-it); border: 2px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.25rem;">
					<ul class="font-body" style="padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; color: var(--fg-pencil);">
						<li><strong>Always Fit the Largest Measurement:</strong> If your bust is a Size 8, waist a Size 10, and hips a Size 14, order a Size 14. A tailor can easily take in the bodice, but adding fabric to tight hips is nearly impossible.</li>
